test "discharge motion period: 21 days after" cite "S.D. Ala. LBR 4004-1, July 1, 2026 rules: OCR extract of an image scan, verify numbers; the value is the vendored OCR text, unverified"
{
  given PlanCompletionNoticeFiled() on 2027-01-04
